OL,3,GNEWSAThree-year-old attempts to
OL,4,Acomplete mountain set
OL,5,
OL,6,FA three-year-old is attempting to
OL,7,Fbecome the youngest person to hike all
OL,8,F214 of the Wainwright fells.
OL,10,FNavy and his family moved to Cumbria
OL,11,Fearlier this year and love going on
OL,12,Fwalks in the fells and he has currently
OL,13,Fhiked 412 miles and climbed 188,000 ft
OL,14,F(35.6 miles) of cumulative ascent..
OL,16,FDad Daniel said he did some research
OL,17,Fand found the youngest person on record
OL,18,Ffor climbing all the Wainwrights was 4
OL,19,Fyears and 10 months old.
